sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Браузер
    participant C as SecurityFilterChain
    participant F as UsernamePasswordAuthenticationFilter
    participant P as DaoAuthenticationProvider
    participant U as AccountDetailsService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    B->>C: GET /login и GET /api/v1/auth/csrf
    C-->>B: React shell, JSON token, анонимная cookie
    B->>C: POST /api/v1/auth/login: form credentials, CSRF header
    C->>C: CsrfFilter проверяет токен
    C->>F: Допустимая форма
    F->>P: AuthenticationManager.authenticate
    P->>U: loadUserByUsername
    U->>DB: Поиск normalized username
    DB-->>U: UUID, username, password hash
    U-->>P: AccountPrincipal
    P->>P: PasswordEncoder.matches
    P-->>F: Authentication с ROLE_USER
    F->>F: Смена session ID, сохранение SecurityContext
    F-->>B: Новая cookie, 200 identity JSON
